# Claude Code local state. Repo-specific skills/agents are planned (none yet,
# hence no /.claude/skills or /.claude/agents content is tracked today) but
# the paths are pre-excepted so they can be added without a gitignore change.
# Two kinds of skill dirs are regenerated by .devcontainer/post-create.sh and
# re-ignored below: the speckit-* skills (written natively by
# `specify integration upgrade claude`) and the externally-sourced ones
# pulled from their own upstream releases.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/agents/
/.claude/skills/speckit-*
/.claude/skills/caveman
/.claude/skills/session-handoff

# Spec Kit: templates/scripts are regenerated by .devcontainer/post-create.sh
# to match the installed CLI (pinned version in .specify/speckit.lock,
# tracked). extensions.yml/extensions/workflows are hand-authored (not
# managed by `specify integration upgrade` — neither manifest lists them)
# and have no regeneration path, so they and .specify/memory/ stay tracked.
/.specify/*
!/.specify/memory/
!/.specify/speckit.lock
!/.specify/extensions.yml
!/.specify/extensions/
!/.specify/workflows/

.env
temp/
/reference/
